  <item>
    <title>002.单口演员的“天菜”日剧竟是这几部……</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/67e2819fdd11f9c8c1053975</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">67e2819fdd11f9c8c1053975</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 25 Mar 2025 10:25:02 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<h2><span>本期嘉宾：王颖@孙悟空空空空</span></h2><span></span><h2><span>以下为剪辑师视角：</span></h2><span></span><p><span>超喜欢的两人聊超喜欢的日剧，听她俩的对谈总有种”原来性格截然不同的两人也能如此合拍“的既视感，好朋友一起聊天就是会在莫名其妙的地方哈哈大笑，这集更是有”你脱裤子我就知道你要放什么屁“的默契。这怎么不算关于友情的故事（坚定）。</span></p><span></span><p><span>祝大家都能拥有让自己快乐的朋友（没有也没关系）</span></p><span></span><p><span>PS.看完《但是还有热情》感觉若林真是高敏感人绝佳嘴替。</span></p><span></span><p><span>【时间线】</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="34">00:34</a> &nbsp;日剧《但是还有热情》和《住住》的简单介绍</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="214">03:34</a> “草食系”的若林正恭</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="408">06:48</a> “毫无魅力点（？）”的山里亮太</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="782">13:02</a> &nbsp;才华值拉满的笨蛋节奏</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="962">16:02</a> ”你会介意别人在你家看你写的书吗？“</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1334">22:14</a> ”离婚后忘带钥匙就得给你开门吗？“</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1682">28:02</a> &nbsp;别人是别人，春日是春日</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1812">30:12</a> ”如果说对于刚才我们讲笨蛋节奏的才华是羡慕，我对于这个春日纯就是嫉妒“</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1987">33:07</a> ”少了点什么的两人“究竟少了什么</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2199">36:39</a> &nbsp;共情时刻</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2575">42:55</a> ”天才就是 &nbsp;无穷无尽的劣等感加上无穷无尽的爱，所以天才往往都无法意识到自己是天才“</span></p><span></span><p><span>（若林正恭对山里亮太的关于天才的陈述）</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Flb0MCTiAW-eT1jc9x7KmAlsWSvi.JPG"></figure><span></span><p><span>【相关剧照】</span></p><span></span><p><span>《但是还有热情》</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FhyYPOeeyqQFLvC9mU9txku63i6j.JPG"></figure><span></span><p><span>（上为剧里的”奥黛丽“，下是现实生活中的”奥黛丽“——左边是若林正恭、右边是春日俊彰）</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FpMZb7Klab9_eyAhP09EzJKqVQ7p.JPG"></figure><span></span><p><span>（上为剧里的”南海甜心“，下为现实生活中的”南海甜心“——左边是山里亮太、右边是山崎静代）</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FnGmiDM9OaEgAaNFgJUFtPZ-1iGx.JPG"></figure><span></span><p><span>《住住》</span></p><span></span><p><span>（最左是二阶堂富美、中间是若林正恭、最右是笨蛋节奏）</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fht4P0linu0a93YSNwtWXdP0KNuP.JPG"></figure><span></span><p><span>《架空OL日记》</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FjnpAtN2aaxEuhvUkC3x_cF2kmf3.JPG"></figure><span></span><p><span>《重启人生》</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FmuGJOSKde7w9iw97IgrEngzM9Sp.JPG"></figure><span></span><p><span>《火花》</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FuASldz7CBRTCev31TId_Gb8IB0F.JPG"></figure><span></span><p><span>剪辑：@嘟了个嘟</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/63cff0188783a87d35db14cf/lqLY2K9SZkKdGgfVBMFT1Afsk2KM.m4a" length="50499002" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:52:02</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FiMVwWXqauEvCxeOXnAeS8HGy2CJ.png"/>
